# Default CODEOWNERS for every repository in this organisation.
#
# Honest state: one maintainer, so this file does not add review capacity
# today. It exists to record which area belongs to whom, so that a second
# maintainer can be added by editing one line instead of renegotiating
# ownership across repositories later.
#
# Patterns are repository-relative and are applied to each repository that
# does not carry its own CODEOWNERS file.

